Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1034-1036] Onigashima+ 40 - Wings of the Pirate King.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.08,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Subtitles by HatSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.79,0:01:29.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-These are Kaido's!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.04,0:01:30.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.25,0:01:32.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can take hold of them,\Nas I too am a dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.22,0:01:43.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if I cannot push it back...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.43,0:01:46.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I can at least halt it...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.19,0:01:52.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...or change its direction...!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.19,0:01:57.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I do not do something, who will?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.78,0:01:59.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.78,0:02:02.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall save my Land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.33,0:02:10.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will not let this island\Nfall upon the Flower Capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.64,0:02:30.65,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(959,782)}That Germa blood you've got in ya has gotta\Nbe goin' crazy right now, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.15,0:02:43.16,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,780)}I want them to be monsters.\NWinning wars is all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.66,0:02:47.66,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(957,782)}I'll grant my children\Nultimate power!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.65,0:03:17.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.57,0:03:21.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn waste of that raid suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.07,0:03:23.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You just keep going on about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.70,0:03:26.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I ain't about to let ya forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.28,0:03:30.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wasted a rare opportunity for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.33,0:03:31.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your opportunity?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.54,0:03:33.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yup, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.04,0:03:36.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All you children of Judge...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.67,0:03:41.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...are cyborgs with not just modified bodies,\Nbut also hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.22,0:03:46.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I had the opportunity to\Nbeat the living crap outta one of 'em,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.26,0:03:50.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and smash 'em into smithereens\Nwith my brand of science!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:03:57.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But since you're here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:04:02.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,how 'bout I give you a taste of what my science\Ncan really do before you die, Vinsmoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.53,0:04:03.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sparking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.57,0:04:03.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sparking...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.49,0:04:05.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.12,0:04:06.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:12.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beams from his eyes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:13.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.35,0:04:33.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is everyone all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.35,0:04:34.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.10,0:04:35.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Staying here is too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.85,0:04:37.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let us retreat further from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.61,0:04:41.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chuji is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.69,0:04:42.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.65,0:04:44.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He wasn't caught\Nin the blast, was he...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.61,0:04:47.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We must leave!\NThere could be another blast soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.71,0:05:00.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't leave without him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.09,0:05:02.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Some!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.72,0:05:05.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Henry...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.09,0:05:09.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.83,0:05:34.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was that one of Niji's moves?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.50,0:05:38.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right on the money, Vinsmoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:46.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Escape this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:55.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How d'ya like them apples?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.10,0:05:58.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I did thorough research\Non Germa's technology!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:06:02.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can copy you\Nin your siblings' moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.32,0:06:07.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Would ya quit\Nlumping me in with them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.90,0:06:13.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was plannin' to show 'em off\Nafter you transformed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.08,0:06:21.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I give ya a beatdown while you're in the suit,\NI could prove to Judge...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.42,0:06:25.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that I'm the better scientist!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.30,0:06:28.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like I friggin' care about\Nwhatever's going on between you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.22,0:06:32.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be so mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.76,0:06:37.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Winch Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.99,0:06:52.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bet ya felt that, didn't ya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.82,0:06:56.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess you were familiar\Nwith that one, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.71,0:07:10.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.85,0:07:16.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, you...\Nyou damned brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.06,0:07:19.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I warned you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.81,0:07:24.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't mention their names\Nin front of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.44,0:07:28.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, so there's no such thing\Nas freedom of speech anymore?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.32,0:07:32.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And another thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.74,0:07:36.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Suit or no suit,\Nthe only thing here getting a beatdown...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.29,0:07:40.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...is you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.33,0:07:46.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Flanchet...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.92,0:07:50.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.98,0:08:05.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think you still got the upper hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.65,0:08:11.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like somebody forgot\NI sent 'em flying earlier...!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.03,0:08:13.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pretty damn sure you felt that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.86,0:08:17.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've been at this for a while...\NYou gotta be getting weaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.99,0:08:22.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Laugh at me all ya want, Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.50,0:08:24.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.75,0:08:29.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...already accepted my fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.38,0:08:32.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not the same guy\Nfrom back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.93,0:08:39.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your weak ass...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:42.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...can't take me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.60,0:08:49.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How d'ya like it?\NHere's your technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.44,0:08:51.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stealth Black!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.15,0:08:54.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you can do even that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.37,0:08:58.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.20,0:09:02.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your backside's totally\Nwide open, Vinsmoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.83,0:09:07.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wha?! He disappeared too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.34,0:09:12.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But he doesn't have the suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.76,0:09:15.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's just movin' too fast to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:23.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He'll eventually run out of energy\Nand show himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.94,0:09:28.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a dumb tactic!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.32,0:09:36.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's with the mouse here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.99,0:09:38.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chuji!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:40.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.12,0:09:41.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.20,0:09:45.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't know when\Nthey will start fighting again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.54,0:09:47.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Some!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.08,0:09:50.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe\Nthat tramp's still moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.01,0:10:04.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go, Vinsmoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.73,0:10:12.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am not Kaido's subordinate!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.11,0:10:15.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm just a geisha,\Nbrought in from the Flower Capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.61,0:10:18.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Some! What is she doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.99,0:10:24.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That wench... She turned me down today,\Nsayin' she was laid up in bed with a headache...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.41,0:10:27.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But she looks full o' energy to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.66,0:10:30.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here I was, tryin' to be all nice\Nas a good customer to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.25,0:10:33.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and she gets all uppity on me! Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.63,0:10:36.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Playin' me for a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.84,0:10:45.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that Komurasaki-tan's gone,\Nyou're my number one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.68,0:10:47.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not gettin' off easy...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.48,0:10:52.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...for lying to me and turning me\Ndown who knows how many times!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.61,0:10:54.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is divine punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.86,0:10:56.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.95,0:11:09.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Poetic justice.\NCause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.29,0:11:11.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Johnny Obviouson!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.79,0:11:14.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.43,0:11:25.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems like you need more pain, O-Some!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.22,0:11:28.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're still not sorry\Nfor what you did...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.15,0:11:38.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What I gained...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.28,0:11:39.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An exoskeleton...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.44,0:11:40.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Muscular strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.44,0:11:42.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And mobility...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.11,0:11:44.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're just extra tools in my toolbox...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.33,0:11:51.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By coating my exoskeleton\Nin finely-forged Color of Arms...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.46,0:11:56.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can cover my leg in\Ntougher, hotter flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.88,0:12:00.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ifrit Jambe!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.30,0:12:02.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,More acceleration! More weight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.68,0:12:04.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the mystery is solved!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.72,0:12:07.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Men should never hit women!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.18,0:12:11.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's been common sense\Nsince the age of dinosaurs!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.73,0:12:14.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was you, wasn't it, Queen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.27,0:12:17.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You piece of crap!\NCollier!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.74,0:12:28.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Queen-sama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.99,0:12:31.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!\NLeave him to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.29,0:12:33.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.29,0:12:39.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vinsmoke Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.01,0:12:49.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Basses Cote!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.81,0:12:51.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paleron!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.14,0:12:55.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jumeau Bifteck!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.94,0:12:58.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tendron!\NFlanchet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.36,0:13:00.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queue!\NPoire! Jarret!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.17,0:13:20.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Germa, Germa, Germa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.00,0:13:22.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That power is so Germa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.80,0:13:24.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut the hell up, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.80,0:13:28.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That name has nothing\Nto do with me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.14,0:13:32.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's obvious to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.14,0:13:37.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...how that evolving power of yours\Nand your future are gonna turn out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.36,0:13:45.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You said you'd never\Nturn into one of the Germa...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.36,0:13:50.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It don't matter how much you deny that power,\Nyou're still a son of Judge!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.99,0:13:52.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.58,0:13:55.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.16,0:13:57.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're an embarrassment\Nto the Vinsmoke name...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.67,0:14:00.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is a black mark on my success,\Nmy secret shame...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.92,0:14:04.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were born a cyborg!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.76,0:14:06.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.72,0:14:11.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter what my past may have been,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.26,0:14:14.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll carve out my future\Nwith my own hands and feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.60,0:14:19.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So your stupid taunts won't work on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.69,0:14:23.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a top-rate sea cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.61,0:14:26.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter how much my body mutates,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.03,0:14:27.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am who I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.19,0:15:02.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I'm also a pirate...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.23,0:15:07.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Black Leg Sanji of the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.70,0:15:15.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I haven't applied\Nmy garnish to you yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.66,0:15:18.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can turn even meat scraps\Ninto delicious food!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.29,0:15:20.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, Queen the Plague!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.66,0:15:24.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut your hole!\NMy science is number one in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.13,0:15:27.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I'm gonna wipe out\Nthe competition all at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.44,0:15:43.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boeuf Burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.24,0:15:56.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lift-off, asshat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.40,0:16:30.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.90,0:16:32.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He looks unhurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.44,0:16:35.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chuji! I'm so relieved!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.53,0:16:37.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was in danger, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.16,0:16:39.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.83,0:16:46.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.17,0:16:49.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was making food for mice again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.59,0:16:55.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't leave her side, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.55,0:16:59.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.43,0:17:03.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How's your...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.64,0:17:05.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...wound...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:07.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.90,0:17:10.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somebody!\NBring the first-aid kit, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.78,0:17:17.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our mother protected her child\Nat the risk of her own life,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.95,0:17:20.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and he was born with\Nthe spark of humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.91,0:17:23.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.54,0:17:26.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...kinder than anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.54,0:17:32.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Battle of the Pleasure Hall,\NLeft-Brain Tower, Skull Dome...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.38,0:17:35.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Winner:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.63,0:17:38.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.47,0:17:41.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A promise, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.06,0:17:43.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But as long as...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.35,0:17:45.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Kaido-san and I are around...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.77,0:17:54.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...you will never fulfill your promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.61,0:17:57.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll send you and that sword\Nyou call "Enma"...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.20,0:17:58.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...straight to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.66,0:17:59.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...straight to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.73,0:18:34.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice try.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.27,0:18:38.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Too bad for you,\NI have a unique physical make-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.11,0:18:40.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Swinging your sword\Nwon't work against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.79,0:18:48.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You, a king?\NAt your level of power?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.42,0:18:51.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My cuts are landing...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.04,0:18:52.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My cuts are landing...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.63,0:18:55.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But they're doing absolutely squat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.22,0:19:01.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Running away, eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.18,0:19:06.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.56,0:19:07.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not like he's unbreakable!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.31,0:19:08.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not like he's unbreakable!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.27,0:19:08.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not like he's unbreakable!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.81,0:19:12.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be\Nsomething to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.31,0:19:13.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be\Nsomething to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.11,0:19:21.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Accept your defeat!\NDie!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.79,0:19:30.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three-Sword Style:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.38,0:19:35.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ultra Tiger Hunt!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.32,0:20:03.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.24,0:20:06.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When the flames on his back go out,\Nhe gets faster...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.87,0:20:10.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...but his defense drops!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.13,0:20:17.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King-sama's mask...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.38,0:20:20.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So the rumor was true!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.63,0:20:24.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Black wings, white hair, brown skin...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.35,0:20:29.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Government'll give you\Na hundred million berries for info!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.10,0:20:30.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's one of the mythical...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.27,0:20:32.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-No, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.77,0:20:34.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Imperial Flaming Wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.11,0:20:44.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The castle's already burning, ya know...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.36,0:20:48.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You oughta try bein' a little nicer\Nto your underlings, if you call yourself their boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.41,0:20:54.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If they're distracting you,\Nwhy not come up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.79,0:20:57.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A hundred mil,\Njust for givin' the Government info?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.42,0:21:01.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.80,0:21:11.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why ask, when you're\Nalready a dead man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.13,0:21:42.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's definitely a unique breed,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.17,0:21:45.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but what he is doesn't matter to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.59,0:21:49.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't got much time...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.85,0:21:57.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If this drags on for too long,\Nmy sword's likely gonna be the end of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.52,0:22:00.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see now the danger you pose.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.44,0:22:04.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Same to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.44,0:22:07.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your reign's gone on long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.07,0:22:09.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Time to clear you all\Noff the throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.33,0:22:13.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't push your luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.20,0:22:16.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido-san will be the Pirate King!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.08,0:22:21.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hate to tell ya,\Nbut that ain't happenin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.21,0:22:26.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Judge of the Afterlife,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.76,0:22:31.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three Sword Style:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.60,0:22:38.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Purgatory...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.15,0:22:43.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Demon Slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.84,0:23:07.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was you that gave me this life...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.17,0:23:09.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Kaido-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.10,0:23:15.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Punk Hazard reporting!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.85,0:23:20.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One of the subjects has gone berserk!\NThey brute forced their way out of their restraints!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.23,0:23:22.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come in! Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.52,0:23:27.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop! Don't come any closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.66,0:23:37.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let us out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.95,0:23:41.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell did we ever do to you?!\NWhat a load of crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.87,0:23:44.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm going to roast the lot of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.48,0:24:06.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.69,0:24:10.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Me? I'm a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.78,0:24:14.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see why the Government\Ncan't let you go...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.91,0:24:17.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're a Lunarian, aren't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.62,0:24:21.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I saw the durability test earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.46,0:24:24.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No wonder you withstood\Nthat raging fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.38,0:24:29.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"No wonder" ...\Nbecause I'm from a legendary race?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.59,0:24:32.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You going to do the same crap\Nto me as they did?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.39,0:24:43.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gettin' out of here and\Nputting together a new pirate crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.52,0:24:47.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you wanna do,\Nguinea pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.82,0:24:59.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make a not-so-fun world fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.70,0:25:02.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Choose! I'll let you decide!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.71,0:25:07.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you change...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.25,0:25:11.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the world?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.67,0:25:15.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one that can!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.60,0:25:25.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Escaped subjects spotted!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.60,0:25:27.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop them at any cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.60,0:25:29.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna blow their heads off!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.44,0:25:34.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not much of a pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.74,0:25:37.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.61,0:25:38.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.21,0:25:47.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothing...\NOur guns don't work on them!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.59,0:25:54.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not too shabby!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.01,0:25:58.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.31,0:26:07.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I haven't asked you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.85,0:26:09.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.94,0:26:11.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alber.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.02,0:26:14.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alber! You're strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.90,0:26:18.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From now on, call yourself "King"!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.95,0:26:21.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.41,0:26:24.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stick with me, King!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.33,0:26:26.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't sell you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.45,0:26:29.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're my right hand man from now on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.31,0:26:48.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The world needs but one king!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.39,0:26:51.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His flames are burning...\NAttacking now is pointless!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.27,0:26:54.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take this, Roronoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.61,0:26:57.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Imperial Flaming Wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.75,0:27:12.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His flames're basically magma!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.58,0:27:46.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doing that again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.33,0:27:55.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not takin'\Nmy swords from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.54,0:28:37.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's speedy! Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.17,0:28:39.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...I can cut him!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.26,0:28:46.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bird Dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.74,0:29:09.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems like you figured out...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.54,0:29:12.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...how I work!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.87,0:29:14.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.33,0:29:18.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finally caught sight\Nof your own defeat?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.52,0:29:37.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ultra...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.94,0:29:40.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,... Tiger Hunt!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.50,0:29:59.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why're you tryin' to block?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.42,0:29:59.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why're you tryin' to block?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.67,0:30:01.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This ain't supposed to\Nwork on ya, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.71,0:30:05.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or are you scared of my attack?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.31,0:31:05.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're biologically incapable of\Ndefeating me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.58,0:31:24.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ain't anything I hate more in the world\Nthan weak-ass excuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.30,0:31:29.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll remember you as\Nthe bold swordsman you were...!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.97,0:31:33.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lemme carve that into\Nyour memory myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.97,0:31:37.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...if you live to\Nremember it, that is!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.64,0:31:43.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Imperial Flaming Wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.21,0:32:46.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Judge of the Afterlife,\NThree Sword Serpentine...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.06,0:33:00.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,103 Mercies!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.68,0:33:02.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,103 Mercies!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.94,0:33:07.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is it, Roronoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.27,0:33:08.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is it, Roronoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.69,0:33:09.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is it, Roronoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.03,0:33:16.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dragon Damnation!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.83,0:33:24.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King Size Imperial Flaming Wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.04,0:34:07.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,K-Kaido-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.12,0:34:11.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You still think so, King?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.59,0:34:14.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That I'm Joyboy?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.26,0:34:18.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The world I'm looking to create\Nis the world you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.35,0:34:23.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A legend is a legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.72,0:34:26.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't wish for anything anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.93,0:34:30.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gave me the life I have now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.86,0:34:33.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must remain the strongest!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.86,0:34:36.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't lose, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.49,0:34:40.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll make you the Pirate King!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.13,0:34:57.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You won't settle for anything less than\Nthe world's greatest swordsman, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.31,0:35:11.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Until the day I defeat him\Nand become a master swordsman...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.85,0:35:15.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll never... be defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.86,0:35:18.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got any problems with that,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.95,0:35:20.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirate King?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.91,0:35:23.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.70,0:35:28.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll become...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.83,0:35:34.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the king of hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.53,0:36:02.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Battle of Right-Brain Tower,\Noutside the Skull Dome...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.41,0:36:09.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The victor:
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.00,0:36:11.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
